rectangle "ArenaServer Game Platform\n<size:16>[Software System]</size>" <<Boundary-QXJlbmFTZXJ2ZXIgR2FtZSBQbGF0Zm9ybQ==>> {
  rectangle "Gateway Service\n<size:16>[Container: C++17, Linux epoll, Reactor]</size>" <<Boundary-R2F0ZXdheSBTZXJ2aWNl>> {
    rectangle "==EventLoop\n<size:16>[Component: services/gateway/src/net]</size>\n\nDrives I/O and callbacks on its owning thread." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsSW1wbGVtZW50ZWQ=>> as ArenaServerGamePlatform.GatewayService.EventLoop
    rectangle "==EpollPoller\n<size:16>[Component: services/gateway/src/net]</size>\n\nRegisters channels and waits for epoll events." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsSW1wbGVtZW50ZWQ=>> as ArenaServerGamePlatform.GatewayService.EpollPoller
    rectangle "==Channel\n<size:16>[Component: services/gateway/src/net]</size>\n\nWraps fd event interests and callbacks." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsSW1wbGVtZW50ZWQ=>> as ArenaServerGamePlatform.GatewayService.Channel
    rectangle "==TcpConnection\n<size:16>[Component: net]</size>\n\nOwns socket state, read/write lifecycle, and per-connection buffers." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsUGxhbm5lZA==>> as ArenaServerGamePlatform.GatewayService.TcpConnection
    rectangle "==PacketBuffer\n<size:16>[Component: services/gateway/src/net]</size>\n\nBuffers partial and coalesced TCP packets." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsSW1wbGVtZW50ZWQ=>> as ArenaServerGamePlatform.GatewayService.PacketBuffer
    rectangle "==OutboundQueue\n<size:16>[Component: net]</size>\n\nRetains partial writes with bounded per-connection bytes and watermarks." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsUGxhbm5lZA==>> as ArenaServerGamePlatform.GatewayService.OutboundQueue
    rectangle "==PacketCodec\n<size:16>[Component: protocol]</size>\n\nValidates magic, version, length, messageId, and payload bounds." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsUGxhbm5lZA==>> as ArenaServerGamePlatform.GatewayService.PacketCodec
    rectangle "==SessionManager\n<size:16>[Component: services/gateway/src/net]</size>\n\nMaps authenticated session IDs to live connections." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsSW1wbGVtZW50ZWQ=>> as ArenaServerGamePlatform.GatewayService.SessionManager
    rectangle "==ConnectionSupervisor\n<size:16>[Component: gateway]</size>\n\nApplies heartbeat, idle timeout, and disconnect cleanup policy." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsUGxhbm5lZA==>> as ArenaServerGamePlatform.GatewayService.ConnectionSupervisor
    rectangle "==MessageDispatcher\n<size:16>[Component: gateway]</size>\n\nDispatches decoded messages by messageId." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsUGxhbm5lZA==>> as ArenaServerGamePlatform.GatewayService.MessageDispatcher
    rectangle "==Router\n<size:16>[Component: gateway]</size>\n\nForwards authenticated messages to the owning game service." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsUGxhbm5lZA==>> as ArenaServerGamePlatform.GatewayService.Router
    rectangle "==TcpServer\n<size:16>[Component: net]</size>\n\nAccepts nonblocking client connections." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsUGxhbm5lZA==>> as ArenaServerGamePlatform.GatewayService.TcpServer
    rectangle "==AdmissionController\n<size:16>[Component: gateway]</size>\n\nEnforces connection and request limits before admitting clients." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsUGxhbm5lZA==>> as ArenaServerGamePlatform.GatewayService.AdmissionController
